<title>NETHERLANDS: GIST BROCADES H1 NET EDGES HIGHER.</title>
<headline>GIST BROCADES H1 NET EDGES HIGHER.</headline>
<dateline>DELFT, Netherlands 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.78 vs   1.71</p>
<p>    Net profit			    69.7  vs  64.4</p>
<p>    Turnover				980.8 vs 890.7</p>
<p>Note - Gist-Brocades was expected by analysts to produce a</p>
<p>net profit between 72 million and 76 million guilders.</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    87.9  vs  79.9</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     3.7  vs   2.3</p>
<p>    Tax				     14.2  vs  13.2</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  55.0  vs  57.0</p>
</text>
